			title: "The Meal"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["24F62B7B528131DA"]
			description: [
				"Every other scroll in the archive teaches you to make something."
				"This one does not. It gates no recipe, names no craft, opens no door."
				"It is a permission slip, and the thing it gives permission for is not written down."
			]
			icon: "historystages:research_scroll"
			id: "64509362B29BEF7B"
			rewards: [{
