			title: "The Path to Divinity"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64509362B29BEF7B"]
			description: [
				"Four objects and one suit of armour, and the claim , unsourced, unsigned, uncontested ,"
				"that each one is a finished god waiting for somebody to put it on."
				""
				"The Apocrypha is explicit on one point and vague on every other: the four are not four."
				"They are four halves of one whole, and the arithmetic is not a mistake."
			]
			icon: "historystages:research_scroll"
			id: "18E0CEF43A4776A9"
			rewards: [
