			title: "The Five Vessels Apocrypha"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"A stone in pieces. It does nothing yet, and that is the point."
				""
				"The bond forms on the fracture, not on the whole , the Apocrypha is unusually clear"
				"about this and unusually quiet about why. You carry the pieces the entire way."
				""
				"Whole, it would end your story here. Shattered, it only starts it."
			]
			icon: "ptd:shattered_philosopher_stone"
			id: "0623F5C8A183F482"
