		{
			dependencies: ["4B9267728C2380CF"]
			description: [
				"One axis held, three let go. It works. It has worked before."
				""
				"The archive is careful to say this is not failure. It is also careful to say"
				"the covenants you did not take go on weakening while the one you did holds,"
				"and that a partial god feels that as a draught they can never find the source of."
			]
