			description: [
				"Crown, Eye, Keres, and a stone still in pieces in your pocket."
				""
				"Hold all four and every sealed god's covenant rests in one pair of hands at once."
				"The archive records no one who has done it. It records a great many who began."
				""
				"You are the first Sinborn in any cycle who could plausibly reach the end of this."
			]
