		{
			description: [
				"The Monarch regalia and the Crimson weapons , the King Below's own court dress."
				""
				"The Apocrypha counts five vessels and describes four paths and has never explained"
				"the discrepancy. This is not a road to godhood. It is what godhood wore"
				"the last time somebody tried this and the world had to be sealed afterwards."
				""
				"It is not a warning the archive expects anybody to take."
			]
