		{
			description: [
				"A nether star, the Homunculus, and the pieces you have carried since the beginning."
				""
				"Every other recipe in this archive taught you to make a thing."
				"This one finishes making you."
				""
				"The clock starts the moment it closes: one heart every eighteen minutes, payable"
				"only in someone else's life. The Convent recorded that most bearers do not notice"
				"the first hour passing. They recorded it the way you record a cause of death."
				""
				"Nothing in the world is locked to you after this. That is the reward and it is the cost."
			]
			icon: "ptd:philosopher_stone"
			id: "13A25089A645C4C2"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 64
					id: "0B255C07D8CB64CF"
					item: "numismatics:cog"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 8
					id: "2479D292A27D7B40"
					item: "minecraft:nether_star"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "The last thing you will ever need to make."
			tasks: [{
				id: "1220579C35636DE6"
				item: "ptd:philosopher_stone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "The Stone Made Whole"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 27.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"You are the full god now, and the first thing you learn is that the seals do not"
				"care which of them you were. They only care that somebody is holding them."
				""
				"There is no successor letter for this. There is no workshop, no cache, no library."
				"There is a person standing where nine civilisations put a lock, doing the job"
				"the lock was doing."
				""
				"The cycle does not end. It is held."
			]
			icon: "historystages:research_scroll"
			id: "2BAD5E6379B657D9"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 64
					id: "4EEED64D0999DD7C"
