			}]
			title: "The Refusal"
			x: 24.0d
			y: 17.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"You take the Warden's seat at the Ender Portal and you guard the one seal you can reach."
				"The other eight stay sealed because they were sealed well, and because you trust the next"
				"cycle to produce its own Sinborn capable of the rest."
				""
				"The archive is unambiguous, and it surprises every reader who gets this far:"
				"this is the highest path. Not because it is hardest. Because it costs no souls."
				""
				"Go build a house somewhere warm. Eat well. Let it end here."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:cake"
			id: "777D7CFAFB41BD75"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
