			}]
			title: "Meal-Warden of the Portal"
			x: 24.0d
			y: 22.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Tradition wants it underground, unlit except by the Manifestor's old crown."
				"Some build it on a hilltop. Most build it where no village can see."
				""
				"The next civilisation wakes in your ruins and finds the altar. Sometimes the Stone"
				"is still in the chest, still warm. Sometimes there is a corpse in front of it."
				"Sometimes there is only the residue , four fluids, in the order you used them."
				""
				"There has never been a Council of Philosophers. You will assemble this alone."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:brewing_stand"
			id: "7C73B7E8BC1A3F59"
			optional: true
