		{
			dependencies: ["5E41492D6074DEB8"]
			description: [
				"They walk into a clearing and the trees are gone in an arc"
				"and the soil is missing to bedrock."
				""
				"They will not know what cut it. That is the legacy , not a monument but a shape,"
				"and the next civilisation has to navigate around the breakage forever"
				"without ever learning what made it."
				""
				"The Breaker is welcome nowhere for long. The world reads Keres in an inventory"
				"the way a village reads a wolf in the treeline."
			]
