		{
			dependencies: ["1B7AC50DEE854A6D"]
			description: [
				"Every Voyager in every cycle has built the same thing: small chests in each of the"
				"five whitelisted worlds. Food, healing, basic tools. Modular. No apparent base."
				""
				"They find them in the Overworld first and puzzle over the contents."
				"Then they find one in the Nether laid out identically, and one past the End,"
				"and the puzzle stops being about the chests."
				""
				"Stand in all five. That is the whole requirement, and it is not a small one."
			]
