		{
			dependencies: ["4B9267728C2380CF"]
			description: [
				"The most legible legacy of the four. Sorted, annotated, indexed. The Heir leaves"
				"footnotes. The Heir leaves marginalia on the predecessor's failures."
				""
				"And sealed in the catacomb, a successor-letter, addressed to"
				"*the next reader who removes the helmet from the rack.*"
				""
				"This is the only path the archive says intentionally repeats."
				"You are writing to someone who does not exist yet and will."
			]
