		{
			dependencies: ["777D7CFAFB41BD75"]
			description: [
				"The seventeen-chapter Cookbook, closed by being served from."
				"The seating chart. The preserved leftovers , the eiswein keeps a long time."
				""
				"The Sinborn who chose the Meal writes no new tradition. They serve everyone"
				"else's, one last time, and leave the book open at the page they finished on."
				""
				"It is the most legible thing anybody in this world has ever left behind,"
				"and the only legacy of the five that a stranger can simply read and use."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:writable_book"
