		{
			description: [
				"The mod-hand that wrote the Apocrypha left an instruction screen behind it."
				"It opens with a title and no author: THE PATH TO BECOME GOD."
				""
				"\"Within you is the capacity to claim the souls of the lower."
				"Nothing is free. However, divinity will only cost the lives of others.\""
				""
				"That is the whole pitch. The archive did not think it needed a rebuttal."
			]
