		{
			description: [
				"Everything after this is the same bottle poured two different ways."
				""
				"One way builds the Homunculus and finishes the Stone."
				"The other way is a potion that takes divinity back out of a person."
				""
				"The alchemists who wrote this down used the same handwriting for both"
				"and did not indicate a preference."
			]
