		{
			description: [
				"Black liquid, brewed the other way."
				""
				"It does exactly one thing: it makes a god a person again."
				"There is no ceremony attached to it and no cost recorded beyond the brewing,"
				"which is itself the strangest entry in the Apocrypha , everything else in that"
				"book is priced in lives, and this is priced in an afternoon."
				""
				"Keep one. You may not want it. Somebody will."
			]
